#. module: pb_hiring
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_hiring/models/workflow_contract.py:0
msgid ""
"When somebody applies on the careers page, send “Application received” to the candidate, right away."
msgstr ""
"Saat seseorang melamar di halaman karier, kirim “Lamaran diterima” ke kandidat, segera."

#. module: pb_hiring
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_hiring/models/workflow_contract.py:0
msgid ""
"When an interview is arranged, send the invitation with a calendar file to the candidate, the panel and the recruiter, right away."
msgstr ""
"Saat wawancara dijadwalkan, kirim undangan beserta file kalender ke kandidat, panel, dan perekrut, segera."

#. module: pb_hiring
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_hiring/models/workflow_contract.py:0
msgid ""
"The day before an interview and again half an hour before, remind the candidate, the panel and the recruiter."
msgstr ""
"Sehari sebelum wawancara dan sekali lagi setengah jam sebelumnya, ingatkan kandidat, panel, dan perekrut."

#. module: pb_hiring
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_hiring/models/workflow_contract.py:0
msgid ""
"When an interview ends, ask each panellist for their scorecard, remind them every day while it is late, and tell the talent lead at %(lead)s."
msgstr ""
"Saat wawancara selesai, minta setiap anggota panel mengisi kartu penilaian, ingatkan mereka setiap hari selama terlambat, dan beri tahu kepala rekrutmen di %(lead)s."

#. module: pb_hiring
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_hiring/models/workflow_contract.py:0
msgid "When all the papers are in, give the recruiter a to-do on the offer."
msgstr "Saat semua dokumen sudah lengkap, beri perekrut tugas untuk penawaran."

#. module: pb_hiring
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_hiring/models/workflow_contract.py:0
msgid ""
"While papers are missing, remind the candidate once a day; when the date passes, give the recruiter a to-do and tell the talent lead."
msgstr ""
"Selama dokumen masih kurang, ingatkan kandidat sekali sehari; saat tanggalnya lewat, beri perekrut tugas dan beri tahu kepala rekrutmen."

#. module: pb_hiring
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_hiring/models/workflow_contract.py:0
msgid "When a background check starts, give the recruiter a to-do."
msgstr "Saat pemeriksaan latar belakang dimulai, beri perekrut tugas."

#. module: pb_hiring
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_hiring/models/workflow_contract.py:0
msgid "When an offer is sent, email it to the candidate with the letter attached."
msgstr "Saat penawaran dikirim, kirim email ke kandidat dengan surat terlampir."

#. module: pb_hiring
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_hiring/models/workflow_contract.py:0
msgid ""
"When every opening has a signed offer, keep remaining candidates without a live offer On hold as Future-fit. No rejection email is sent."
msgstr ""
"Saat setiap lowongan sudah memiliki penawaran yang ditandatangani, simpan kandidat lain yang tidak memiliki penawaran aktif dalam status Ditunda sebagai Cocok di masa depan. Tidak ada email penolakan yang dikirim."

#. module: pb_hiring
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_hiring/models/workflow_contract.py:0
msgid ""
"%(days)s before somebody joins, ask the recruiter, the hiring manager and HR whether it is still on."
msgstr ""
"%(days)s sebelum seseorang mulai bekerja, tanyakan kepada perekrut, manajer perekrutan, dan HR apakah rencananya masih berjalan."

#. module: pb_hiring
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_hiring/models/workflow_contract.py:0
msgid ""
"When somebody joins, tell the hiring manager and the people who get the new joiner ready."
msgstr ""
"Saat seseorang mulai bekerja, beri tahu manajer perekrutan dan orang-orang yang menyiapkan karyawan baru."

#. module: pb_hiring
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_hiring/models/workflow_contract.py:0
msgid "When a role gets its recruiter, tell the recruiter and their manager."
msgstr "Saat sebuah posisi mendapatkan perekrut, beri tahu perekrut dan atasannya."

#. module: pb_hiring
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_hiring/models/workflow_contract.py:0
msgid "When a colleague refers somebody, tell the recruiter."
msgstr "Saat rekan kerja mereferensikan seseorang, beri tahu perekrut."

#. module: pb_hiring
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_hiring/models/workflow_contract.py:0
msgid "When a role opens to referrals, tell every colleague with a login by email."
msgstr ""
"Saat sebuah posisi dibuka untuk referensi, beri tahu lewat email setiap rekan kerja yang memiliki akun login."

#. module: pb_hiring
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_hiring/models/workflow_contract.py:0
msgid ""
"When a recruiter shares a candidate with somebody, email them that they were given access."
msgstr ""
"Saat perekrut membagikan kandidat kepada seseorang, kirim email kepada orang itu bahwa mereka diberi akses."

#. module: pb_hiring
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_hiring/models/workflow_contract.py:0
msgid ""
"When an agency puts somebody forward, give the recruiter a to-do for a first look."
msgstr "Saat agensi mengajukan seseorang, beri perekrut tugas untuk peninjauan awal."
